            "rationale": "The change adds no new effect below Tier 4, and the new Tier 2 code (standings, writeOffSmallChange, Settlement) is pure. However, it extends a Tier 4 CLI branch that interleaves a store load with a domain decision. That decision is not in a pure Tier 2 function, so it can't be tested without the store. Presentation is deciding instead of asking Tier 2/3.",
