            "rationale": "Most facts now have one definition. Accounts.unpaid is used by owed, writeOffSmallChange and waive. The duplicated 5.00m literal and balance computation are removed from the CLI, and blocking now uses Policy.blockingBalance through isBlocked. One fact is still restated: the 'fully paid / not waived / not written off' classification appears in both Payments.paidUp and Views.fineStatus. The two agree for now, so this is a minor restatement.",
